From: Nikolas Jack Altran <237433426+njaltran@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:18:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add pane.read local-control action

Adds a pane.read action and `warpctrl pane read [--lines N]` that returns a
terminal pane's visible content. It reuses the terminal view's accessibility
content, so it returns the alternate screen when a full-screen program is
running and otherwise the recent blocks plus the input line.
